    "description": "## Objective\n\nEnable Multiple Currencies with CAD and USD active so currency values can be entered on Deal, Sign-Up, Player, and Referrer records.\n\n## Implementation Requirements\n\n* Enable Multiple Currencies\n* Activate CAD and USD; set corporate currency to CAD\n* Use static current exchange rates\n* Do not enable Advanced Currency Management\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n* CAD and USD are active\n* Currency fields render and convert on test records in both currencies\n\n## Testing Notes\n\nOne test record per currency.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\nDated exchange rates (Advanced Currency Management).\n\n## Open Questions\n\n* Client to confirm static current rates are acceptable long-term; dated rates require ACM, which is irreversible once enabled.\n\n## Additional Notes\n\n* Multi-currency enablement is irreversible and adds CurrencyIsoCode to every record.\n* Must be separately enabled in production before deployment.\n\n---\n\nEstimate: XS · \\~2h · Dependencies: POC-01 · Ticket POC-02 (approved 2026-07-04)",
